Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Revert: enable Power Throttling (remove override)
; Pair with: disable-power-throttling.reg
; CURSOR-AUDIT #20: per-file revert restores Windows default behavior
; (PowerThrottlingOff absent = OS-managed throttling).

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Power\PowerThrottling]
"PowerThrottlingOff"=-
